tiveMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7468401","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7468401,"initDialog":746840101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[30551],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/EffigyChallenge_V5_74684/Q7468401","priority":5,"questId":74684,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":746840101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":365293138,"text":"Thanks for your hard work over the last few days. We did deviate from our original goal, sure, but I for one have gained much from these experiences.","nextNodeIds":[746840102,746840103]},{"nodeId":746840102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3676989402,"text":"It was quite the series of battles, yes.","nextNodeIds":[746840104]},{"nodeId":746840104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3824691002,"text":"Gained much... Don't you mean you learned a lot of lessons?","nextNodeIds":[746840105]},{"nodeId":746840105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":662568506,"text":"That too, yes. Cultivating friendships is a long-term process, and you need to spend more time after making your pick, not like what we did this time...","nextNodeIds":[746840106]},{"nodeId":746840106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":1995703626,"text":"Just like Natlan was once the land of ancient dragons, and is now a land where humans and Saurians put mutual trust in one another, becoming comrades who live side by side... I wonder how long that must've taken.","nextNodeIds":[746840107]},{"nodeId":746840107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":1484816202,"text":"*sigh* I suppose I was too overeager. I thought we could gain their respect by beating them, which is why I picked such blunt methods.","nextNodeIds":[746840108]},{"nodeId":746840108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":82726250,"text":"If we had taken our time from the start... Perhaps feeding them every day and trying to get closer to them might have boosted our chances!","nextNodeIds":[746840109]},{"nodeId":746840109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1216260658,"text":"That sounds reasonable enough until you remember that the targets you picked aren't your everyday dogs or cats.","nextNodeIds":[746840110]},{"nodeId":746840110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":3690604594,"text":"True, true. They're more like the Saurians of Natlan — that is why I picked them, after all.","nextNodeIds":[746840111]},{"nodeId":746840111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":1510503874,"text":"I imagine that my friends there would understand what an extraordinary thing I've done when I relate these experiences to them.","nextNodeIds":[746840112]},{"nodeId":746840112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3051949082,"text":"Paimon still doesn't see the similarities — the Primo Geovishap aside — but you do you.","nextNodeIds":[746840113]},{"nodeId":746840113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":1674272730,"text":"Hmm? The others were quite similar too. The colors, for example...","nextNodeIds":[746840114]},{"nodeId":746840114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":945414674,"text":"If that's where you're headed, then Slimes would also be similar enough, no?","nextNodeIds":[746840115]},{"nodeId":746840115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":264660338,"text":"I see where you're coming from. They are both elemental creatures... Perhaps Slimes do have the potential to become Saurians...","nextNodeIds":[746840116]},{"nodeId":746840116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":1708302906,"text":"Does that mean that I should try making friends with Slimes first?","nextNodeIds":[746840117,746840119]},{"nodeId":746840117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2924614346,"text":"This plan's suddenly looking very scaled down.","nextNodeIds":[746840118]},{"nodeId":746840118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1670353002,"text":"It feels much more doable now, too.","nextNodeIds":[746840121]},{"nodeId":746840121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":2241645498,"text":"Haha, still, I won't know till I try!","nextNodeIds":[746840122]},{"nodeId":746840122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":2168599218,"text":"Thank you two so much for your help. With any luck, I'll have gained a comrade or two for my adventures, enough to qualify as the \"protagonist\" of my very own tale.","nextNodeIds":[746840123]},{"nodeId":746840123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","textMapHash":127370474,"text":"Have a pleasant journey!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":746840119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1869284922,"text":"Slimes would be a safer option, if nothing else.","nextNodeIds":[746840120]},{"nodeId":746840120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":736048562,"text":"It's all relative, though. We often see newbie adventurers and ordinary passers-by rendered immobile by Slimes who've surrounded them.","nextNodeIds":[746840121]},{"nodeId":746840103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1769031458,"text":"I feel like the opponents you picked were especially tough...","nextNodeIds":[746840104]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7468401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30551"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7468401],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30551,"speakerName":"Ranjit","count":13},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":4}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[174684],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":4262555726,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/EffigyChallenge_V5_74684/Q7468401","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"",